  "id": "butternut-squash-soup",
  "name": "Butternut Squash Soup",
  "subtitle": "Warm, gently spiced soup with a creamy finish",
  "description": "Tender squash, aromatics, and warming spices are pressure-cooked in broth, blended smooth, and finished with cream.",
